<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- USHAMA</book>
  <para style="h">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc3">ROM</para>
  <para style="mt">ROM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Otakarda uni o sher bando numi gyam Bulus, bugyam bo Botʻbwakimga Yesu na bu swabo bone bo Onhon o ogage e zwammagaa anabare a tusongo a eb.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Bone bo Onhon ushi kama'iri yinu tun na Jigu, bando yinu atuma a Onhon na so shitak she ob she bura̱̱. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Anabare a tusongo ate zwam Bwa bo ob ne, Bot-butuwaga na buti Yesu Botʻbwakimga, bone bando o kingi bushi bo ebenchi e Dauda, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Ama bando nagu turiya to eb to uhuchi ishi bwa bo Onhon na iko ab zwame nani bando owashinga eb bando ana a owagi <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Bando Yesu gatu hi iyi bura̱̱ na tuswabo, zwam reze re eb ato duniya kuchi a tane mahinda a swabi henda. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Uni ushi taba na gahi ato tonge to Roma, ana a Onhon o ogage ishi ato a Yesu Botʻbwakimga. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Otakarda uni ushi o kuchi nuhi gahi ato ana a Onhon o kudage ana a yo na Roma, ana a za turiya ana a Onhon o ogage.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Baka Onhon Buchi na buti na Botʻbutuwaga Yesu Botʻbwakimga bo me pa iyi bura̱̱ na ashinya a bura̱̱<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Menga Me Godu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Na Jigu, na on gwadaga Onhon numi bando Yesu Botʻbwakimga zwam gahi kuchi, zwam kuchi ato duniya a hogo taaje o etano'emahinda nihi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Onhon ushi sheda numi kuchi ene e gyamu zwame ishi mahinda, Onhon one o gyamu on gyamata na kuchi so numi bando e zwamgaa e anabare a tusongo a bwa bo Onhon. Onhon o daki ene e gyame butare <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Kuchi gagu o gyam on menga. na on roko Onhon nezwama, shi ene e gab on binu, ko inga e hi yeno o koro wo gahi. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Zwam na on tukudago e me hya zwam e me pa tupano tu mai tu uhunchi tune twa me panga mahonre. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ene e gyamu on eba ne, tu panga mahonre ma hato nati, gyam na me panga mahonre ma so bando etano'eso nimi wo Yesu gahi ma ena panga mahonre bando etano'eso nihi wo Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />A hunwa, na kudage e daki nezwama na shiu shir dinya e koro wo gahi, ama har yanzu ana yenswa e sha nani. ekudago e koro zhnumi eba ne zwam eshi biguba̱ wo gahi ta gyam shi na so ana aza yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />A zhe honbe o koga na reto rinimi, re ato shepo na re ato shi'undu, re ato edaku na ana aza edaku. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />ob o nsa gyam shiu neya e me zwama anabare a tusongo gahi kumba ana ayo na Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mahonre ma anabare a tusongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Anabare atusongo ate ashi iyi mu'e ba wo gyam, zwam abane ashi iko e Onhon ane araga shibkaga kuchi ana a tanomahinda wo echago, na jigu wo ana aza yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Zwam bando anabare ate a tusongo ne aba araga chibaga adalchi a ne ayo bando Onhon e be yo, henda a hyangu adalchi ate bando etano emahinda na jigu har koro akundaga. ta ob o yo herange na so here Onhon nezwama,&lt;&lt; Bot bo adalchi, bando etano e mahinda ne bob bwashi muhondo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E hachigago Eso e Onhon Bando Ato Turiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Zwam araga chibaga ta Onhon wari na turwana owa shagi ato aduba na so shen ob bando nagu o hale a Onhon na enk a mugunta a ato ana araga Yansanga mahinda bando enk a mugunta mwaba. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Zwam e ne aba pwa daku na reto re Onhon o yo swabciya̱ na wo aba, zwa Onhon ne o sabchiu yek. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />So o tuswe e to Onhon na hend iko e ob o dududu ba iya aba pwa hya na risha ba ama tun na jigu o duniya a chibano irine sabchiya, apwa daku yek bando iyi ene e Onhon ushi. zwamnani ato aza dalili o maya! <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Zwam ko na ob o yo yek a daki Onhon, kuchi nanani yek echibano oik egodu ba, nanani ma, tumane haba a shiu suba, so owaba o nagu kamabutarya hend a shiu tunshi. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ko na yek a zach ashi ato tuenge, ama yek ashi adamba. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Aba bariki e edanduwa e Onhon one oza a a owagi koro mahoga mashinu ta bot bwa owagi mashinu ta bot bwa owagi, na hend mahoga mashinu munono, na hanuga, na ene e yo ta shahwa na shikadagi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Zwamnani Onhon o tuta yek wo e shagu e mugu o sha'awa o hakoko haba, na kingi kaba henda yek shagu iyi mu'e na reto ryaba. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Yek barikiu mahenda ma Onhon tak. yek gyamata iyi ene a ba shi, har yek on shagyaga yek hidima maimako a shagi bune bu shi yek ama reto re bob, bu ne bu dama a shagi boik kuyabo har dududu kaniya. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Zwamanani Onhon u tuta yek wo sha'awa shine she sapago mu'e a'a ba a guwa bando kama haraga o bwaa na buri one uba, ushi honzhe bando a ba shi bot koro kamaharaga one o yo honzhe ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Nani henda na sha'awa she hato haba she su reto ryaba pa ato tware a guwa kamaharaga na a'a ba one ob ushi honzhe bando a ba shi bot. ato tware na a'a a on shaga iyi mu'e nanani yek a zhangi hato haba aduba ana ashi dade na hamugu o enk aba.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Na ba ge a yo na edaku e Onhon, pa Onhon o tuta yek bando tunane o banza na suba zwam yek ashi ene e kamache ashi ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />yek ayo shinji na ko iri nyana nagu adalchi, na mugunta, na kiryane, na kama wondo o so, aba shiji na tushibiya, na e hono e bot riʻu, na bitaga, na tuwaryanu, na so shiri, yek ashi ato guluma. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Ana a hachigago reze, ana a on ga ba na Onhon, ato zwage a e dandago o reto, ana a on kama dandaga hato haba, ato e parago e mugunta, a na a swabagiwa a acheche haba. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />A shi ana a za hankali, ana a shindagiwa kamaira yinu, a na a za tukudago, na a nagu o ehogo e nyama. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />yek a daki kaida o Onhon nezwama kuchi bune bu shagu enk ane yek a kamache u'u, ama ba yek a on shagu iri ne suba ba, har ma yek a on gudaga ana a on shagu nani.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Aduba a Onhon A yo honzhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Zwamnani gab bone bo gab on shagi bot mai aduba, buza huja o mai, ko gab shi ga, zwam gagu o gab shi ga, zwam gagu o gab raga shagi bot mai aduba buraga shagi reto re nebe ba un, zwam zwam makwada ma gab hya bot mai na mabe maba ne gab yo na mab. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Zwam tu dagi nezwama achiba a Onhon ayo honzhe na reto re ana araga shagu iri ne. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Gab bot! gabwa buna hend sha iri mane makwada ma gab hya bu mai na mab! Bu on tunane nezwam gabwa wutagwa aduba a Onhon ne? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ko hend bu on renaga iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon, hankuri o ob, na nagu o so shen o ob kyabokyabo wo ga bo? A she, bu daki ne zwama iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon o on eb ne e raga kabu numagi ko ro kama ginduguwa ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama bando o tube a giso a gab raga shaga na so o tukanga o gab zhe, buraga kama zuranga udubu ane a raga kabo baraga oho o so shen, o Onhon na gagu aba chibano aduba ane a yo bando iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Onhon owa topeu koga bando enk a bob. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Azhe ane a kudage edandago na daraja na muhondo mune muza a hwagi, bando kamahima owaba, bando isha e iyi bura̱ na so na ma ibpa, aba ne Onhon owa tupeu yek na muhondo mu dududu. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ama ane ashi a kama kudago o reto, ana a kudagiwa mahinda, a on hend shaga mugunta, a tupen yek na so shen na tuzuma. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Maduru na wahala aba ne araga baraga ko ga bune ko shagu mugunta, na jigu wo yahudawa, ka tomowo ana aza yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ama kuchi bune bu shagi ene ishi iyi bura̱ bwa hi edanduwa na tuwaga na ashinya a bura̱̱, na jigu wo yahudawa ka tomo wo ana a za yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Zwam onho o chibaga ezagyagu ba.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Kuchi ana a shagi turiya ba na edaku e aduba a Musa ba, yek a pu ba na echibaga eni ba, ama kuchi ana ashibaga eni, a shagiu yek aduba bando echibaga ene. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ba bando e hogo e echibaga ene suba e pwa sa ato yo na adalchi wo Onhon ba, ama isha e enk na echibaga ene ne aba raga zwamaga naba ashi ato adalchi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Nane a shiwo yahudawa aza echibaga e musa kuchi nanani, araga shaga ene echibaga ene e sape, bando ene e so owaba o pa yek. Ashe hend ana aza echibaga ene azhe e chibaga nyaba ba un. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Enk aba e chibano nezwama, ene e echibaga ene e zwame e yo pane heryange na shi so shaba. Na so hakoko hab hend azhe sheda wo iri ne, zwam tamagone owaba o raga bangyaga yek na makwada na gagu oink, na gagu o mai hend o bangyagu yek na makwada ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Zwam nani, ta anabare a tusongo ate a gyam raga zwamaga aik a on zwamaga, nani ob owaya oho Onhon bando Bot-bwakimga Yesu nya shagiu kuchi ene e yo na tuswe e na so owato.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa na echibaga e Musa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />To, gab bune bo gab raga kana ogaga Bayahude? bu on shanga na echibagano e Musa, bu on henda makungu na tukusa na tuhi na Onhon, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Gaboi zwamaga we budaki ene e Onhon o on, bu yo na edaku bando echibaga e Musa ta gwabwa yinga ene e yo honzhe. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Bu yado nezwama gab shi butusha go aruba ne, tubanga wo ana a yo na so tunshi <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Bai chibaga e ana aza turenge, na Umarumi wo ato so o awo a nuwa. zwam bu tabatu nezwama na so echibaga e Musa ne bu yo na edaku dinya na mahinda henda. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />To, gab bune bu gab raga chibaga reto nebe gab bune bu gab on mupas nezwama ata sha buhi, gab shi buhi ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Gab bune bu gab zwame ata sha tugari, bu shagi tugari ba? Gab bune bu gab kudage mahogaba, bu shagu buhi wo egenga e mahoga ba.? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Gab bune bu gab on makungu na echibaga e Musa, bu da̱ru reze re Onhon bando egundu e echibaga e ob ba.? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ta, ob oyo herange na so here e Onhon, &lt;&lt;Zwam gahi yahudawa aba shagu uje o makwada zwam reze re Onhon na so ana aza yahudawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Shi bu on swabi echibaga e Musa, kochiya na kabe ka zhe ampane ba un. Ama shi nagu e swabo gab unshi wo echibaga e Musa, owa nya ba a bu shagiu kachiya ba ba un. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ashe shi ane aza kachiya araga shaga ene echibaga e Musa nyange ashi, Onhon owa zhagu yek ta ana a za kachiya. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ana a za kachiya ka kingi ama araga shagu ene echibaga e zwame ashi, a bu shagiu aduba, gab bune bu gab zhe echibaga e Musa herange, bune buraga gundaga echibaga ene. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Zwam Baya hude bu mahinda ba bot ne bu ba yahude bando kingi suba ba, henda kachiya ka mahinda ba kayo bando kingi ko bando egundu e taka ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Nanani henda, Bayahude bu mahinda buba ne bushi Bayahude bando so, hend kachiya ka mahinda kab ne kachiya ka so, wato iyi e uhunchi ushi, ba bando echibaga nyaba herange ba iri bot buni henda Onhon ne o raga shagi bot buni kuyabo, ba bot ba.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />To, inga ampane nami nezwama gab shi Bayahude? inga hend reba o kachiya? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Azhe hend, bando o ko owana yena Na jigu, yahudawa abane Onhon o pa yek amana na reto re ob e behenrya bite bene bi shi be Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ama shi ato yink a chibano nagu o etano emahinda? etano emahinda e Onhon ishi e suba ba unu? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Nani ba? ko chimu! Onhon o yo na mahinda, ko na ob ushi ko ga buchi bot bu tak. ta ob o yo na so otakarda Onhon owange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Zwam a daki taazhe nube shi mahinda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">bu hyage hend ko ga gagu owaba on binchika na reto nobe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />To, shi nagu o adalchi nati u shiu yena o echibano e adalchi a Onhon no, nya gatwa zwamo? twa zwam Onhon ushi bot bu nagu o adalchi shi o tu shereu aduba? Na on shi taazhe ta koga bu shagu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Nani ba! ko chimu! shinani ne in ta Onhon owashagi duniya aduba?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Shi nagu o mahinda namami o sape mahinda ma onho ma machibano sabchiya dinya, ushi henda iyi kisanga e dandago e Onhon, to, zwam nya har yanzu ana shagiu aduba nezwama gyamshi bot bo turiya? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Shi nani ne ba se ture tusha na e sha e mugunta zwam ushi yena o hiu o iyi bura̱ e Onhon ba? Ato yink a o tazhe o e hachigago o reze niti a be zwamaga na ni gatu zwame, a shereu ato ani na aduba ta ob oshiu honzhe a shagi yek.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />To, inga ba unu? unbu gatu yahudawa tu hyange ato mai ne Nani ba! ko chimu! tu rego tu chibano nezwama na yahudawa na ana aza yahudawa kuchi a zhe makwada, yek a yo na henda kuchi yek a yo na karkashi o iko e turiya. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />ta ob o yo herange na so otakarda o hera Onhon nezwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Aza Bot bu adalchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:10">Aza, ko boink.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Aza bu mai boi gano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Ko bu mai boi mungeu mo Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Kuchi yek a pa Onhon yensa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Yek a shiu ana aza ampane kuchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Aza, bone bu shagi nagarta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Aza, ko boink<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Ogwandogwando owaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">ta u'uyi one o yo sabchiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Kare kaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">A shiu iyi e warensumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Tazhe owaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Ta mangare ma mugu awa.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Yinu yaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:14">E yo shinji na taaje o shiri na kura.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Yek azhe tukyabkyabo to e kwanga e mahi,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Kuchi wo aba ura, se e pwatumu na so shiri.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Yek a daki yeno o ashinya a bara ba.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Aza hend ryansa re Onhon na risha ryaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Tu daki de nezwama kuchi ene e echibaga e musa e on zwamaga, e on zwamaga ana ayo na karkashi o eb ne. uni o yo nani kuchi zwam a nyashe ana a on gembo o huja, a chibane henda nezwama duniya kuchi o yo na karkashi o aduba a Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Zwam aza bune bwa hiu ashiya a nagu o makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon bando o yo na o getago ene e echibaga e zwame ashi E ne e echibagano ene e shagu eba ne e chibane bot turiya tu bob.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adalchi bando etano e mahinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama yanzu henda a chibano yena o mai o e hiu e adalchi a Onhon zagu a ne adalchi hend ba bando echibaga e Musa aba hyagu aik ba, ko na ob ushi echibaga e Musa na hatakarda a tumana a shagu taaje na reto re eb. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Adalchi ate ane a sher wo Onhon, a hyangu aik ne bando etano emahinda na so Yesu Bot-bwakimga, Onhon o pa adalchi a ne wo kuchi bune bu tane mahinda. Ba henda e zaigyagu, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Zwam ko ga bu shiu turiya henda ko ga bu ma shembe eshe wo daraja Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />A ma bando iyi bura̱̱ ene e Onhon ushagi ko ga suba ko ga bu hi ashinya a nagu turiya na bishina̱ be Onhon bando echago e te e Bot-bwakimga Yesu ishi. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Onhon o tuta Yesu uhanchi o ezhangu e ketopo ke turiya na tuti, zwam bando uhanchi o eb a yapen ato turiya twaba bando etano emahinda maba, Onhon ushi nani zwam u chibane adalchi a ob, zwam bando kama ibga o ob o gageu turiya twaba shi tun na jigu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />nanani Onhon o chibane adalchi a ob na gagu uni, zwam ob na reto re ob o zhe adalchi, henda o sapago kuchi bu ne bu tane ma hinda wo yesu bu hi ashiya a nagu makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />To, na reto re nya gatwashi makungu? Ai, a za iyi maya! Bando nya aba zhagi makungu? Bando e getago e echibagano e Musa? A'a se de bando etano emahinda. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Zwam gatu yado nezwama bando etano emahinda ne aba hyagu ashiya a nagu makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon, ba bando eswabo enk echibagano e Musa ba. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ko hend Onhon, ushi Onhon o yahuwa suba, aba ba? tamahinda hend, ob ushi o ato ana aza yahudawa taba, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Zwam Onhon o yo oink, owa sa a to kachiya a hi ashiya a nagu makwada wo ob bando etano emakimga hinda, nani ma ana aza kachiya a hi ashiya a nagu o makwada bando etano emahinda ete. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Shin, tu zhangu echibaga e Musa ba unu bando etano emahinda eniya? ko chimu! Nanani ma, tu on tabbataga aik.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Egagau e Ibrahim.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />To, nya gatwa zwam o na reto re ibrahim, A kaka a shikaka na shiti, bando kinki? Nya eb e gane zwam tazhe o etano emahinda? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Shi Ibrahim e hiu ashinya a nagu o makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon bando enk a eb ne ezhe iyi makungu ene eb nyashi ba un, ama ba na bishina̱ be onhon ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />herya e tazhe o Onhon nyange, &lt;&lt;Zwam Ibrahim e tano emahinda wo Onhon, pa Onhon o rutage iyi bura̱̱ ne wo ob.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Bot bune bu on shi enk a ketopo, ketopo ke bob ba suba ba, ketopo ke enk a bob ne. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />to, Bot bune bo yinsa bando enk a bob ba, ama bu yinsa wo Onhon one o raga sapaga ana a za hale a Onhon a hi ashinya a ana a za makwada wo ob, a zhangu etano emahinda e bot bute ta iyi bura̱̱ e bob binu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />une ushi ene e Dauda o on na ob ushi taazhe zwam iyi bura̱̱ nyaba shagi bot bo Onhon owange na bob, bot bo adalchi, ba bando enk a bot bu ne bushi ba nezwama,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Bot bu yinu bura̱̱ ne bune</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Bwaba yapeu boik turiya tu bob tu mamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Bune bwaba yapeu boik turiya tu bob.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Bot bu yinu bura̱̱ ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">Bune bo Onhon o rutago turiya tu bob ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Yinu bura̱̱ ete e yona ana azhe kachiya ne suba, ko henda taba na arna ana a za kachiya? Ai, ene e gatu on zwamaga e shar bando otakarda o Onhon ne, nezwam, &lt;&lt;Bando Ibrahim aba rutage etano emahinda ma eb adalchi ne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />To, na gagu owana aba zwame na Ibrahim bot bo bo adalchi? yensa owaba shagi ek kachiya, unbu kape a shagi ek? Ai kape a shagi ek kachiya ne. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ama na eb e che bizabo be kachiya, ane a shiu sheda o adalchi ane a eb ezhe bando etano emahinda ma eb, tu kape a shagi ek kachiya zwamnani Ibrahim ishi buch bo ato etano emahinda wo Onhon, zwam a rutage yek ashi ato adalchi ko naba za kachiya. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Nani ma Ibrahim ishi buch, bando ana a zhe kachiya ana a ba kachiya suba aba zhe ba, har ma a raga swabi egagau e etano emahinda ma Ibrahim e zhe kape a shagi ek kachiya.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">kama ira e Onhon na etano emahinda e Bot.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />kama ira e te nyaba shagi Ibrahim na ebenchi e eb nezwama nyare gado o duniya,ai, ba bando echibaga e Musa aba shagi ek ba, se de adalchi ate aba raga hyangu bando etano emahinda. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Shi da ana a on swabi aduba a musa aba ne are gado o duniya, ai, etano emahinda e bot ishiu suba ba un, henda e bot ishiu suba ba un, henda kamaira o Onhon e shiu wopi ba un. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Zwam echibagano eraga zhangi so shen o Onhon, ama shi esapo e za, aza ta aba shi nagu e hogo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Zwamnani, bando etano emahinda ne kama ira ene e e yinsa uni henda zwam ushi bando iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon, zwam henda a tabachi yek bando ebenchi e Ibrahim, wato, ba bando ana a yo wo e chibagano e Musa ab aba ba, ama ta ba na ana a yo na etano emahinda ta Ibrahim ishi, Ibrahim ebe shi butuwaga na buti kuchi <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ta ob o yo heryange nezwama, &lt;&lt;Na bu tano ushi buchi bo ebenchi dinya.&gt;&gt; wato, a tabatu na kama iri e ni. bishina̱ be Onhon bune bu yo na etano emahinda wo ob, buba ne henda bu panga muhondo wo ana a owagi. bu ba ne hend bu zhe iko bu oge ene e za ba e nya.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ko na uba shi etano emahinda e Ibrahim e hiu ta suba ne, kuchi nanani e reu tusha na etano so, e be shi etano emahinda har ishi &lt;&lt;Buchi bo ebenchi dinya.&gt;&gt; Uni henda bando kama era nyaba shagi ek ne, nezwama, &lt;&lt;Nani ebenchi nebe nyashi udubu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Na gagu ani henda Ibrahim eyo na shekara Buini, ama e shiu tuda'u bando etano emahinda ma eb ba, ko na eb e daki mahonre ma kingi ka eb maraga hwagi zwam tuʻonga, na henda ta Saratu e kurewa gagu eb e pwa mache. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />E shiu shak na kama'ira e Onhon na nagu etano emahinda ba, ama e kisano mahonre bando etano emahinda ma eb, e be dandaga Onhon <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />E yo henda na tabachi nezwama, Onhon o yo na iko o shinji kama era ob. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ob o nsa aba rutage etano emahinda ma Ibrahim adalchi ne wo ob. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Uni taazhe nezwama, &lt;&lt; a ba rutage etano emahinda adalchi ne wo eb,&gt;&gt; ba zwam eb eba aba heryange ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ama a heryange taazhe uni zwam gatu, gatu ana a Onhon owa tu rutago ato adalchi, wato, gatu ana a gatu yo na etano emahinda wo bune bu anshigatume Yesu Bot-butuwaga na buti bando ana a owagi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Zwam turiya na tuti ne aba tuta Yesu bando U'u, henda a anshingatumo ek na muhondo zwam tuhi ashinya a nagu makwada na bishina̱ be o Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ene Nyaba Hyangi Bando Etano'eso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Zwam nani shi da ubu shiu tu hiu ashiya a ana a za makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon, bando etano emakimga hinda, tu yo na ashinya a bura̱̱ na Onhon ba u bando Bot-butuwaga Yesu Bot-bwakimga. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Bando bob ne gatu hi eso iyi bura̱̱ ene e gatu yo shani so bando etano emahinda niti. Tu on hend so chen zwam tu on tanaga so nezwama twashi ato kama harago na so a dande a Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />ba nani saba ba, har tu on so chen na so maduri na mati, zwam to da nezwam maduru ma raga zhagi ma'ibpa, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Ma'ibpa ma zhangi hale a bura̱̱, hale a bura̱̱ henda a zhangi etano e so. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />E tano eso ete nya shi iyi banza ba ko chimu, zwam Onhon o zhuta tukudago to ob na she so nashiti bando uhuchi o bura̱̱ one o Onhon u tu pa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Zwam dede o gagu, ogagu o gatu pwa kana banga ba, Bot-bwakimga bu u zwam gatu, gatu ana a gatu za hale a Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Iyi maduru ne bot bo mai bu u zwam bot bo adalchi, ko na uba ushi, opwashi bu mai bu pwashi mahonre ma so bu u zwam bot bo hale a bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Onhon o tu tabbatu na udubu o tukudago tu ob tun gatushi a turiya Bot-bwakimga bu u zwam gatu <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />To shi gatu hiu ashinya a nagu o makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon bando mahi ma Bot-bwakimga . <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />To gagu o gatu sayo na bitaga na Onhon aba tu kimga na Onhon bando u'u o bwa bu ob bale yanzu aba rego atu kimga na Onhon atu chago bando tuhano to Bwa bu ob ba un <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Hyange nanani har tu so chen zwam ene e On hon ushi bando Bot-butuwaga Yesu Bot-bwakimga bune bo bando eb ne aba tu shireu sakane tuni na Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu na Bot-bwakimga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />To, Ta turiya tu eshe duniya bando bot boink, turiya tu te tu zhangi u'u bando nani ne u'u o swabe ato duniya kuchi, zwam ko ga bushiu turiya. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Kame a tuta echibagano e musa, turiya tu yo na duniya. Ama a shagu kuroto ko turiya shi de e chibagano e kaza ba. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Kuchi nanani u'u ushiu tugwam na reto re ato kuchi daga zamane o Adamu koro Musa har tushiu iko bando ana a shiu turiya to gunji e aduba ba,ta o Adamu o yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu henda egagau e e pano e suba e Onhon ene e on kore. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama e pano e suba ene e Onhon o bando bone bu un kore, o yo zagu na e gungu e aduba ane a adamu ashi. Hingyana, e gundu e aduba ane a bot boik bushi a zhagu ato dinya u'u Ama iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon e hyangu tuwaga, har e pano e suba e ob ushi bando iyi bura̱̱ e bot boink bute, wato Yesu Bot-bwakimga, e sape yinu e bura̱̱ e tuwaga e raga kisanga wo ato dinya. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Tamahinda henda, e pano e suba e Onhon e yo zagu na turiya to bot boink bute. Zwam eshereu e aduba ene e shabe yensa o turiya tute tuba ne aduba a u'u, ama tupano tu suba to Onhon opa, abane a tu zhagi aduba a nagu makwada na bishina̱ be ob ko naba ushi tu shiu turiya dinya. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Bando turiya tu bot boink, wato, Adamu, u'u ushiu tugwama wo ko ga, ama esha e tugwama turiya tushi konyaba, shi a hutarya boik na tune to bot boink, wato Yesu Bot-bwakimga bu zhangi wo ana a on che iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon na tupano tu ob to adalchi na bishina̱ be ob bando ob ne yek ashi tugwam na so muhondo mwaba.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Zwamnani, ta uba ushi bando e gungu e aduba a bot boink koga, nani henda esha e adalchi e bot boink e zhagi iyi bura̱̱ wo ko ga. wato e hiu e ashiya a nagu o makwada na bishina̱ be Onhon na henda muhondo mu pu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ta ato dinya ashi ato turiya bando nagu ehogo e bot boink, nani henda ato dinya shi ato adalchi bando ehogo e bot boink.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ene e sa aba shibke aduba a Musa eb ne, zwam makwada ma sher sabchiya. Ama gagu o turiya tu kisanga, se iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon e raga kisanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Zwam ta turiya tushi tugwama to tob bando u'u, nani henda iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon e on tugwam to eb yanzu bando adalchi, zwam etu shebke wo muhondo mu dududu bando Yesu Bot-bwakimga Bot-butuwaga na buti.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">U'u Bando Turiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />muhudo wo Bot-bwakimga nya gatwa zwama ?Tware tusha na ashiya a turinya zwam iyi buri Onhon e kisaga? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />ko ko chimu! Aiturigo tu u bando turiya inga henda ta gatwa re tusha na ashiya wo oba <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />A she e daki ba kuchi nuti emakimga aba tu shagi Baptisma koro wo u'u o eb ne aba tu shagi Baptisma <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />W ato bando o Baptisma nuti a ba tu wunba taba na eba tu shiu hend boik na eba na so u'u eb zwam ta aba a nshingatumu ga tume Bot-bwakimga wo ana a owagi bando iko e te edanduwa o buchi, nani ma gatu shi ashinga a muhondo mo pu <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />shi de gatu rego tushiu yink na eb bando iri wu oeb tama hinda twashi yik na eb bando owashinga eb bando ana a owagi <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Tu daki hend ne zwama a rego a getanu mutuntaka na muti mu da taba na eb zwam a shan gi iko e tunya tuni tune tu yo na kingi na kati ashi nani zwam tu ka shakana agyam a turiya <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Zwam shi bot bu u bu hiu echago bando o turiya bu un. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Shi tu rego tu u taba na Bot-bwakimga, tutano mahinda twanya na muhondo taba na Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Zwam ta daki ne zwama, anshinga tumo Bot-bwakimga bando ana a owagi, hend nya owaka ba, wato, u'u o zakana mahonre na eba. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />wo o ne o Yesu ishi, e u kinka tak, ama muhondo mo eb e onshi, muhondo wo Onhon ne. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Nani hend gahi ma e zhagi hato nahi ta ana owagi bando mahonre ma turiya, ama yek ashi ato muhondo wo Onhon bando Bot-bwakimga Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Zwamnani, eta yada turiya tushi iko wo kingi nakahi ka owagi, har tume sabe e swabi mugu o sha'awa o tuba. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />E ta tuta hend hagami nahi wo turiya, ashi hazunga a enk a mugunta. se de etuta hato nahi wo Onhon, ta ob o kamache na ana aba zhangi yek bando wa u'u koro e hiu e muhondo, e hend tuta hagami na hi wo Onhon zwam ashi hazonga a enk a adalchi. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Tunrinya twashi tugwa na reto nihi ba ,shi de gahi shi na karkashin o turiya yo ba ama na karkashi o iyi bura̱̱ Onhon<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agyam a Adalchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Inga unu? wato se tushi turiya zwam echibaga iniya e za iko na reto niti se iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon? Ma! ko chimu! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />E daki ba shi tuta reto niti zwam ishi ato aswab wo bu maiya e shi agyame na wa bone bo gahi on shagi boik e hogo e teshe ? E pwa shi agyam aturiya tuni tu shgu kor wo u'u ko henda agyam a eswabo wo Onhon one o shangu koro adalchi <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama egwadu e tabbachi wo Onhon, zwam ko na ob ushi da gahishi agyam a turiya ne, ama yanzu kam e onshi eswabo na kuchi so nuhi wo iri e chibagano ete aba mai tane na so eb. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ame chago gahi bando turiya, e shiu henda agyam wo adalchi.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Na on hend kame shagya taazhe ta ato a on kame shagya taazhe zwam kama shimba nuhi ushi o kingi nakahi wo tuggam to iyi turiya, na hend wo mugunta mone mo on kisanga suba, nani ma nyanzu se e tuta kingi na kahi wo tugyam to adalchi, zwam ishi ana aba iyinga na nagu o turiya wo Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Gagu o gahishi a gyama a turiya ba ruwa nuhi na enk a adalchi. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />E hiu ampane a nya na bando iri niya ene e nyanzu eme shigiu iyi mu;e? Ai, ketopo ke iri ne u'u ne! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama nyanzu a me chago bando tugyam to turaya, e shiu hend agyam a Onhon. Ampane a gahi raga hyanga wo ene eb ne eme shibke wo ashiya a nagu o turiya, ane a on kame machi muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ke topo ke turiya u'u ne, ama tupana to Onhon tu su ba tuba ne mu hondo mo dududu bando Bot-bwakimga Yesu Bot-butuwaga .<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ushinya ushi e gagau nuti na Bot-bwakimga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />To, Ahunwa nami, gahi ana a gahi da e chibagano e Musa, nya daku ene e gyamwa zwamo. e chibagano ete e raga shi iko wo bot gagu o bot hiu yo na muhondo ne suba. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Misale, bwaa bu ushinyana, e chibaga e Musa e para boik wo bwariya gagu o bwariya buyo na mu hondo. Ama shi bwariya bu u, bu hiu echago ba un wo e chibaga ene e para boik na bwariya. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Zwamnani, shi bu shinya hiu mai gagu o bwariya bu yo na muhondo a zwamo na bob bwaa bu tugari. Ama shi bwariya bu u bu hiu echago ba un bando e chibagano e e para ushinyana. shi henda bu shinya omai, bob bu on shi tugari ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ahuwa, uni ushi e gagau wo gahi. Bando kame hutarya nihi na kingi ke Bot-bwakimga, e shiu ana a owagi wo e chibagano e Musu, zwam eshi ato eb, wato, ane aba a shingatume wo ana owagi, zwam e machi tuhano tu bura̱̱ wo Onhon, ta e'o ene e matage awo a bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Zwam awo ana ayo na ushe o iko e hale a kingi, e chibaga e raga subkya mugu o sha'awa nuti. sha'awa uni henda o raga shi enk na so kingi na kati, henda kuchi enk nati a raga katu machaga u'u. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ama yanzu henda, tu hiu echago bando iko e e chibagano e Musa zwam tu u bando ene e tu para. zwamnani yanzu, tu on gyamata Onhon bando tuhano tupu o uhunchi o ob. Tugyam to gosh tu gatu shagi hadokoki a na a yo heryange o karegeu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E chibaga e Musa na iko e turiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />To, nya gatwa zwamo? e chibaga e Musa ishi turiya? A'a ko chimu! Ai, aza ta gyamwa daku ene ishi turiya shi ba bando e chibaga ene ba. shi e chibaga ene e zwano ne zwama, &lt;&lt; Uta sha kiryane ke iyi bu maya.&gt;&gt; Ba, ai, na ka daki ene aba ogage kiryane ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ama zwam esapo ene, pa turiya tu hi yinu eso o sape ko iri kyana kiryane na so numi. henda shi bana e chibaga ene ba, turiya to rabto u'u wa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Da kam na yo na mu hondo, gagu o gyam daki e chibaga e Musa ba, ama na gyam daki esapo ene, pa turiya tu maringe na muhondo, gyam henda na u. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Na daki henda nezwama esapo ete nyaba kudage e zhangi muhondo, ena zhagya u'u. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Turiya tu hiu yinu eso ob, henda bando esapo ene ena waryatumi e na hono henda.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Zwamnani, e chibaga ene ishi e iyi ene e za turiya, esapo ene ishi ene e za turiya e zhe adalchi, iyi bura̱ henda. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Wato, ko a zwamo, e chibaga ene ishi iyi bura̱, ena zhangya u'u ba nu? Nani ba! ko chimu! bando e chibaga ene, ene ishi iyi bura̱, turiya tuna zhangya u'u, zwam a chibane ta turiya tu yo. wato, bando esapo ete turiya to sher sabchiya na nagu bizagi be tuba.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gas one o yo na so bot zwam turiya to bob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tu daki de nezwama e chibaga e Musa iyi ne e uhunchi. Gyam henda nashi bot bo hale a kingi, bugyam suba na wa turiya. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Na gano ene e gyam oshi ba, zwam ene e gyam kudage ishi ba, henda ene e gyam kudagiwa, e bane e gyam on shi. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Shi henda ene e gyam onshi e bane e gyam kudagiwa ishi, na yada ba on nezwama, e chibaga ene ishi iyi bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Wato, ba gyam na reto rinimi ne gyam raga shaga iri ne ba, se de turiya tune tu yo shani na kingi na kami. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Na daki nezwama aza iyi mai e bura̱, ene e yo shani na kingi na kami, wato wo hale nami a kingi. zwam nayo na niya ishi ene e yo honzhe, ama isha e nani ena gagaro. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Na shagu iyi bura̱ ene e gyam kudage ishi, se de na on shi mugunta mune mu gyam kudage ishi ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />To, shi na onshi ene e gyam kudage ishi ba ene e chibane ne zwama ba gyam onshi iri ne e gyam onshi ba, se de turiya tute tuyo shani na so numi.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Pa gyan hya, shi na kudage ishi ene e yo honzhe se e hya mugunta taba na gyam. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Zwam na so usha o so numi, na yado na e chibagano e Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />ama na so hagami nami na on hya omai kaida o hankali nani a zhan ene henda o parage na kaida one o turiya. one oyo shani na hagami nami. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Kaito numi, iyi e hogo e nyama ne gyam ga bwana chago gyam bando o kingi kane ka wutagu bando u'u. <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />egodu e tabatu wo Onhon zwam una chago wo Yesu Bot-bwakimga o Botʻbutuwaga nabuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 7:25">Zwama nani, gyam reto narimi e chibaga e Onhon ne gyam on gyamaga na hankali nami ama na hale a kingi kaida ene e za e bura̱ ne gyan on gyamata.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eshanu Bando mahonre ma uhunchi Onhon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Zwamnani yanzu aza henda ekazhiwa bando ana a shagu kama haraga na Bot bwakimga Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />ka ida o te o uhunchi one o panga nmuhondo one oyo bando Bot-bwakimga Yesu one cheu bando o kaida oturiya na o u. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Iri ne o hadoba a mashenbeshi, zwam hade amatuhinjha, Onhon ushiu wato o kazhiwa u,u na so kingi, na ob o tumane na Bwa bo ob na so kingi, na ob o tumane na bwa bo ob na shinu kibngi kani katu ka turiya zwam e guzagu e turiya. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Uni zwam ashindagi honbe a hadoba ne na reto niti, gatu nana a gatu on ashinya a amatuhinjha ba, se de ashinya a uhunchi. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ana a on ashinya a amatuhinjha, ai,a raga tanaga yishaba wo enwe ishi e amatuhinjha, ana a on ashinya a ene shi e uhunchi henda a shanga na wo ene ishi e uhunchi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />E tanaga e yisha bando ene ishi tukundaga nyazhangu u'u, ama etanaga e yisha bando ene ishi e uhunchi henda bwahi muhondo na ashinya a bura̱̱. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Zwam etanaga e risha bando ene ishi e amatuhinjha bitaga ne na Onhon, zwam eswabagi hadoba a Onhon, zwam eswabagi hadoba a Onhon ba, ba henda bwa pwaba. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ana a on ashinya a amatuhinjha a dama a pa Onhon so chen.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ama gahi kam, ba ashinya a amatuhinjha gahi onshi ba, ato ashinya a uhunchi ne, shi de uhunchi o Onhon oyo shani na sheso nashihi. kuchi bone boza uhunchi o Bot-bwakimga henda, boza boza bo Bot-bwakimga. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama shi henda Bot-bwakimga bo yo na so nuhi, ba ruwanuhi na turiya ba unu, uhunchi henda muhondo ne wo gahi zwam e hiu adalchi a Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Shi uhunchi on hon ene o owashin gatume Yesu bando ana a owagi oyo na nuhi, to, uhunchi one owashingatume Bot-bwakimga Yesu bando kingi kate ka owagi, bando uhunchi o ob one oyo na sheso nashihi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Zwamnanani, ahuwa, e hya, ashinya amatuhinjha aza honbe omaya har na gatwashi ashinya ab. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Shi e on ashinya a amatuhinjha, nya owagu ba un, ama shi na uhunchi o bura̱̱ gahi hone enk ate a ashinya a amatuhinjha,nya hi muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Kuchi ana a uhunchi Onhon o raga chibaga yejk asbashi awo a Onhon <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ai, uhuinchi o gahi che ushi o tugyama ba, har gahya maringe ashitya a ryansa. A'a, ashi ashinya a awo, har gatu ogaga,&lt;&lt;Gab Abba, buchi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Uhunchi Onhon na reto re ob ma, tabana uhunchi nuti a raga panga sheda, nezwama gatushi awo a Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Shi henda gatushi awo, ashe, tushi ato gago henda, ato gado Onhon achagiya a gado henda na Bot-bwakimga, shi de tu on su madurau taba na eba, henda a tu dande taba na eba, henda a tu dande taba na eba.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edanduwa Ene Nya Koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ai, na ishanu nimi, maduru ma gatu raga swagi na duniya uni, madama a kamanchi mek na edanduwa ene ab tu pa ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Hingyana kuchi ene Ohon ushi erga hoge matambi, eraga ushi eraga hoge matambi, eraga tanaso o kama chibano o awo Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ayinsao ene Onhon ushi ishi subs ba na nupi o eba ba ama na nupi one o bone bo yinsane yek. kuchi nanani azhe etano'eso, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Zwam a chago ene e Onhon ushi na reto retba ma bando o tugyam to epwaso, zwam e hi yanchi e te, e edanduwa e awo Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Tu daki de kuchi ene e Onhon ushi e raga honge maduru, e raga su azaba henda uiri a bwaa bo mamata, har koro yanzu. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ban nanani ma, har gatun na reto niti ngatu ana a gatu hi uhunchi o bura̱̱, ene ebe shi eyeno Jigu, bando ene e gatwa hi, tu on muhondo na so nuti, tu on tanagaso o eshindu niti e awo Onhon, wato, echago e kingi kate kate na kati ba un. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Gagu ab tu chage ne gatushi, iri ni etano'eso. Ana henda, ai, etano'eso bando eye ab hi, ba etano'eso bane Ga bwa tano so bando ene e bob bo hiu. <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Shi henda turaga tanagaso bando ene gatu hiu ba, na malpa gatu bake yek.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Nani henda uhunchi o raga katu bangaga bando tuneb tuneb na tuti, zwam gatu daki ma ene e kamachie gatu kaba ba, ama uhunchi na reto re,ob o raga kabaga zwam gatu na maduru mane ma hyange bishina̱ bya zwamage. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ama bone o daki sheso nashiti bo daki ene e uhunchi o on. zwam bando ene e Onhon on ne uhunchi oraga kabaga zwam ana aza turiya.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu hyange Azwame Na Gatu Ato Nasara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tu daki henda iyi kuchi uhunchi Onhon a raga shagu taba, koro iyi bura̱ wo ana a kudage Onhon wato, ana a Onhon ogage wo tugyama to ob.<note caller="+" style="f" /> <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ana a Onhon orego o yinga yek tun naJigu, ab ne Onhon o tane yek a zhanji shinu bwa bo ob, zwam bwa buniya bo shiu bo Jigu bando ahuwa dinya. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ana a Onhon o tane yek henda, ab ne ob o chage. Ana a Onhon o chage ani henda, abane ob o dande.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />To, nya naye gatwa zwamo na irini? shi, de Onhon o yo na yesa niti, ga henda bo pwashi bitaga na gatu? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Onhon one o yanso bwa bo ob ba, o pa boik ma zwam gatu kuchi, ashe, owatu pa konya taba na bwa wa biryagya ba? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ga bwa tano ana o Onhon o yinga makwada? Onhon ne o raga chaga yek! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ga bwa shereu yek hadoba? Bot-bwakimga Yesu bone bo u, ko henda a zwame bone bo On roko zwam mashinge bando ana a owagi boba ne boyo shani na wa katuga ka Onhon, zwam gatu! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ga bwa pwa katu habsa na tukudago tone to Botʻbwakimga bo raga katu shagyaga? kunchi ne? ko tuyenzo ko tuzuma? ko remyaro? ko nagu iyabudaga? ko hasari? ko bitaga? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ta ob oyo herange nezwama &lt;&lt;zwamgab ne ab raga katu hunaga huru kumbu, atu nrutago ta tame nyashirange&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Kuchi nanani na so hale ani kuchi har tu hyange a zwame na gatu ato nasara, bando bone ne bo tu kudage. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Zwam na tabatu, ko u'u ne, ko mu hondo, ko tuma hagamba, ko tuma hagamba a tuwaga, ko ene shi e yanzu, ko bando ene e nya kore, ko ato iko, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />Ko geso, ko tukwara, kai, ko iri nyana ene ishi e Onho9n ushi,e pwa katu undagaga na tukudago tone to Onhon oraga katushagi bando Bot-bwakimga Yesu Botʻbutuwaga na buti ba.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Onhon O yinga Ato Isra ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Gyam Bulus mahinda gyam on kame zwammagaa, gyamshi bo Bot-bwakuinga, ba tak gyam on shi ba, so numi bando uhunchi o bura̱ oraga panga sheda, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />nezwama nashe so nshiri dinya ne henda na nagu one oza a hwagi na so numi. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Shi aka na tano yinu wo, ana habusa na Bot-bwakimga zwam ato nami, ahuwa nami a kare! <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Abane Isra ilawa. Na ashinya a awo Onhon, na ehyanu e edanduwa eb, a kama ira yinu ete, na tupana to hadoba, na tugyama, na henda kama ira yinu ene eryata kuchi ishi yaba. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Shikaka nashikaka shite hemdaashi ab, Botʻbwakimga henda bando ashinya a eb bot, ishi e kare kaba kuyabo ko tabachi wo Onhon dududu, ob one oyo zaat na konya kaniya.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ba nezwama taaje Onhon o zwame ba, zwam ba kuchi ebenchi e tonge to Isra ila ashi Isra ilawa a mahinda ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ba henda kuchi owaba ashi awo a Ibrahim ba, nezwama ab shi ebenchi eb ba. Ama ange, &lt;&lt;Bando Ishaku ab rutago ebenchi nebe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Wato, isha e ebenchi e Ibrahim, ba eb ne ishi e awo Onhon ba, a'a ebenchi bando kama ira o yinu ete ne ab on rutaga ebenchi e Ibrahim ne ab on rutaga ebenchi e Ibrahim. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Kama ira o yinu obane, &lt;&lt;Humai nani na kurwaka, saratu bwaa nabobe bwa bo matuwa bwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ban na nani ma, gagu o Ribkatu ishi mukaba na bot buni boink, to kaka nakati Ishaku, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />tun eb e mato awo ani ba, bale ashi a mai e bura̱̱ ko enagu bizagi zwam ene e Onhon on bando eyinga e ob e tabatu, ba bando enk a ketopo ba, se bando ogo ob, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />ab ange na eb, &lt;&lt;Bo Jigu bwa gyamato bwa kundaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ta ob o yo herange nezwama, &lt;&lt;Yakubu e kudage, Isuwa e be wonje.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />To, ny7a henda gatwa zwano? Onhon ushi nagu adalchi ba unu? a'a, ko chimu! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Zwam Onhon o zwame na Musa &lt;&lt;Bone bo gyamwa shagi boik e hogo e nyama, na shagi boik e hogo e nyama, bone bo gyamwa chibano boik e hogo e to yama henda na chibano boik yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ashe, henda, irini ishi bando nupi o bot ko turenge to bob ba, se bando e hogo e yama e Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Zwam na so nasi a zwano na pir'aunam, ,,Na bo pa tuwaga ne zwam e chibane iko numi wo gab, zwam henda azwamagaa rezae nimi na so ato, duniya kuchi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />wato, oraga chibaga e hogo e yama wo bone bo ob o kudage, o raga henda tauraru so o bone bo ob o kudage.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />owashi o zwame na gyamu, &lt;&lt;To, zwam nya har nare ob oraga hyanaga makwada? Ga bo pwashi bitaga na ene e ob o on?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Gab bumabotuhinjha! Gab shi ga har gabwa shi buitaga na ene Onhon on? Ashe, iyi ne e bumaga bo ma e pwa zwame na bone bo ma ek,&lt;&lt;zwam nya gab na mushi naniya? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />ASse, bone bo mago ekimbu bozhe mahonre na tonge twamage, bo ma ekimbu e maya zwam enk a bura̱̱, emai henda zwam enk ana aza a bura̱̱ ba, kyuchi bando egoda toge to te tuink? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />To, inga de? Onhon na ob o kudaga o chibane so shen ob, o chibane iko e ob henda, pa ob o ma ibga na malba bando ana a kamachie so shen ob ab henda a dama epwatum. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ene Onhon on ne o chibane udubu o edanduwa ob wo ana ob o yama yaba, wato, ana a tun naJigu ob o shagiu yek yinu edanduwa? <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Wato, gatwa bona ana a ob o ogage ba henda na so yahudawa suba ba, har na so ana aza yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ta de Onhon o zwame na so atak a hHosiya nezwama, &lt;&lt;Ana a da ashi ato nami ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Na zwamo naba ato nami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Ana henda ashi iya kudage nami ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Na zwamo naba ,iya kudage nami&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />&lt;&lt;Wo pani pa ab zwame naba, &lt; Gahishi ato nami ba,&gt; pate ne ab zwame naba &lt;awo a Onhon o muhondo,&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Zwam Isra ila, Ishaya e dande bigwaba nyange, &lt;&lt;Ko na ob ushi udubu io Israilawa o kurewa ta hyaga ne wo ab a hi echago. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />zwam Botʻbutuwaga bwa shireu hadoba a bob na duniya, o hwagi oik nanakanda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ta, butuma Ishaya e zwame nezwama, &lt;&lt; Da ba zwama Botʻbutuwaga bo konya bo tu geu ebenchi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">Tu ka shiu ta saduma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">A tu maringe henda ta gwamrata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ato Israila na Anabare a Tusongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />RTo, nya henda gatwa zomo? hingyana, al'ummai ana a mahimaniwa bando genmbo adalchi a Onhon, a hiu aik, wato a hiu adalchi ana ayo bando etano mahinda <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Israilawa henda ana a mahima bando o gembo yeno o adalchi a onhon, pa yek mashimbe hi aik. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Nya sa? zwam yek a gembo aik bando oyeno etano mahinda ba, se de bando o yeno isha e enk a ketopo. pa yek ashi udubuta na te udubuta, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />ta ob oyo herange ne zwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;hingyana, na tano te one o sapago udubuta na sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Na one o sapago ehinago.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Kuchi bone bo tanomahinda na ob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Bwa hogo mu'e ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Gahi ahuwa , ekudago e so numi na henda roko numi wo Onhon zwam ab, obane yek a hi echago. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Na shedu yek nezwama yek azhe kamahima wo tugyama to Onhon, ama ba na edaku dinya ba. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />zwa nagu o edaku e yeno o hi e adalchi a onhon, ane a Onhon o hyangya yek a wanje swabi yeno ate o hi e adalchi one o Onhon o pa <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Zwam Bot-bwakimga bob buchi yeno ote o eshindu e hadoba, zwam ko bwana boi panga emahinda bu hi adalchi Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Zwam musa o herango taaje o adalchi ana a raga hyanga bando eswabo e hadoba, nezwama kuchi bone bo pwa shi aik bwa nya na muhundo bando ab. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />ama, bando e hi e adalchi a Onhon ane ayo bando etano'emahinda owange ota zwama na reto nebe, &lt;&lt;gamba bwa hyana wari na turwana?&gt;&gt; wato, bo kozhatuma Bot-bwakimga. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />ko henda, &lt;&lt;ga bwa kazhiya wari na tunge wo hari o tugwanre?&gt;&gt; wato bo a shingatume Botʻbwakimga bando ana a owagi. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ana nya nasi owange? &lt;&lt;Taje uni ai, oyo kusa na gab, oyo ma na yinu nebe na henda na so rekoko nebe.&gt;&gt; obshi taaje o etano'emahinda e gato raga pasaga. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Wato, shi gab na yinu nebe bo yado nezwama, Yesu ishi Botʻbutuwaga bo tanomahinda na rekoko nebe Onhon owashingatumo Yesu bando ana a owagui, bwahi echago. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Zwam na rekoko bot bwatanoma da bo hi adalchi a Onhon, na yinu bot bwa zwama bo hi e chago. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />zwam nasi owange, &lt;&lt;kuchi bone bo tano mahinda na Yesu bwa hi mu'e ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ai, aza babanchi omaya bando bayahude na ba'al'ume Botʻbutuwaga bote boink bob bushi Botʻbutuwaga bo koga, bo udubu o tupano bando kuchi ana a shagu manga wo Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Kuchi bone bo shiu menga henda na rezae re Botʻbutuwaga bwa hi echago.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ama inga Taabashi manga wo bone bo yek atanomahida wo bob ba? inga henda Taaba tanomahinda wo bone bo yek tabo hoge ba? inga ta henda ab hogo shi aza bo mupasa? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Ingata henda ab shi mupas, sha atama yek ba? Ta ob oyo herange na atak a Onhon nezwama, &lt;&lt;Iyi bizagi ne bot bo hya ko mapunda ma bone bo on kore bushi mupas mo anabare a tusongo.<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama na on kaba,ato Israila yek a hogotaaje uni ba? mahinda a hogo <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" /><verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" /><verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Har nare , na on kaba. shin israila da, a gano ba? Na Jigu de Musa ochane gagu ob ogane Onhon owange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;na me tano tushibiya to ana aza alama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">na me sapo so shen henda na al'uma a mai ana aza turinge&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Ishaya henda e zwamo na reto re ato israla nyange</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;ana ana genbago ba, ab nahi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Nama chibano bando ana ana gimbago edaku nimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ama zwam israila, pa ishaya nyange &lt;&lt;Hunru kuchi na tuta wa nimi bando ato, ana aza eswabo, ato bitaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ehogo E Nyam E Onho wo Ato Israila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />To, na on kaba. wato, Onhon o barikiu ato ob yensa ba unu? A'a, ko chimu! Ai, gyam ma na reto renimi nashi Ba'isra'ila, bo ibenchi e ibrahim bo kabila ka Biliyaminu. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />ko chimu, Onhon o barikiu ato ob Yesu ba ana ob o yinga tun naJigu ba. Gahi daki ene e nasi o zwame ba, na reto re Iliya ba? Ta eb e shibke oto wo Onhon, na reto re Israila, nyange, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, yek a hunago atuma nabe, a huzagu ebaro nebe etuta uhanchi. gyamgyamu ne gyam ryanta̱, yek a on gembo o muhondo namumi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ama nya Onhon o chane ek? owange &lt;&lt;Nama gitagiwa ato dubu ota ana a tabo hunka ba'alba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Nani ma na azamane ani azhe ana a ryanta̱, ana ab yinga bando iyi bura̱ ob. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />shi henda bando iyibura ne, ezane zwama we yinsa bando enk a ketopo ba unu. in ba nani ba, ashe, iyi bura̱̱ ishi iyi bura̱̱ ba unu ba.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />To, inga ba unu? Ashe, ene e iisraila e on genbo, e hiu ba unu, ama ana ab yinga a hiu, ana a ryanta̱ henda a hagagiwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ta ob oyo herange na ataka a Onhon nezwama, &lt;&lt;Onhon o sape sowaba, na rekoko ryaba ana a hugagewa, koro nane apwa hya ko a hogeba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Hend dauda owange</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt; Ga ushiya owaba umaringya hako owaba ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">Iyi e zhangya e hadari .</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">Ga yek a shi udubuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">E zhangi yak udubu ba<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ga yisha ba a shi tunshi har a pwa hya ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">tu chara to maduru tu zuta wo yek har dududu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Echago e ama aza yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Har nanani na on kabaga Na ato Isra,ilawa ashi udubuta a hinago har yak a mashingeu ba? Nani ba: ko chimu Zwam turiya twaba echago e eshe wo ama aza yahudawa, Zwam a sape Yahudawa a hoge tushibiya twaba <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Shi henda zwam turiya twabashi tu zhangya duniya iyi bura̱ shi kama shimba owaba opa ana aza ya hudawa Iyi bura̱ to inga ta iyi bura̱ ete nya nya gagu udubu o Yahudawa o shidu kuchi. <verse eid="ROM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Yanzu na gashi ana a gahi shi Yahudawa na on taazhe. tunda gyam shi butom bo Yesu koro wo a na a za Yahudawa nashi makungu na enk nami chimu<verse eid="ROM 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Na e shi e nani na on menga nezwama na pa sape ato isra,ila a hoge gore har uni ma a sape a chage ato yinka <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Sha ka sha e wondo nyaba aba shi ushiu yeno o e gunje o yena o kama kimga sakane o Onhon na duniya gagu o aba cheu yek henda ba e hinwa e muhondo bando ana a owagi ne one owa zhangu ba? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Shi a getago gungu onk a kapuka ka bero e kweno ko jigu bando e tuta e kaba wo Onhon a guzagu kuchi kapuka kane ba un, shi hend a yinga Onhon o ganda e'o kuchi shigogo shine a guzagu shek ba un . <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />To a gundagu shegogo shi maya she e'o e zai tun ene nya ba tuma pa ba zhagi agogo a mai a e,o e zaitun ene e yo na ozanga para yek ushiya gahi ana a shiwa Yahudawa ta agogo a e'o e zaitun o uzanga gahi yo gahi ne aba e para na ripitu rete, wato yahudawa a ne a bando aba ne gahi raga hyaga iyi bura̱ e Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Zwama nani eta sha makungu ne zwama e hyange shegogo shi te ya shaba gundagi. Shi henda e on makungu, se e ma butare ne zwama, ba ripitu rete ya re yinsa zwam gahi yinsa zwam ripitu rini. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ama bu pwa zwam, &lt;&lt;Ai, a gundagi shegogo shini zwam a hi wo aba na para na ripitu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Nani henda! Ama zwam nagu o etano emahinda ne aba gundagi shek na ripitu, gab henda bando etano emahinda ne gab yo na dama o yo taba na ripitu. zwamnani ta sha makungu Nanani ma henda, o hoge ryansa. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ama shi Onhon o go shegogo shi te ba shine shishi she ripitu ba, gab ma a bu geu ba. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Pani tu pwa hya ta Onhon oyo na yinu bura̱ na henda tuzuma. O chibano edaku ob wo ana a hinage, Ama o chibano iyi bura̱ wo gab, wato shi bu zago na shiya abo wa iyi bura̱ ob. Shi henda bu reu tusha na na ni ba, gab ma a bu gundu wo ripitu rini ba un. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Shi henda israilawa a reu tusha na nagu o etano emahinda ba a hutara yek na ripitu, zwam Onhon o pwa maringyatumo yek wo ripitu. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Gahi ana a gahishi yahudawa ba, eyo ta e'o e zaitun e te e ne e yo na uzanga e ne e shi aba gunji oik, pa ba para oik, pa ba para oik ushiyana na e'o ene nyaba<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onhon o chibaga e hogo e nyama wo koga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Na kudagiwa e nya na nagu o iri niya, ahunwa, e ta zhaga hato nahi eshi ato turenge. ma ibpa mate mane mashi ma dududu ba ma bangi israila ne, har udubu o ana aza yahudawa ana a e so wo Onhon o shidu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Nanani aba chago yahudawa kuchi. Ta ob o yo heryange ne zwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Bwa chagiya bwa koro na sihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Bwa zhangu nagu e swabo e Onhon wo ibenchi e yakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Uni ushi kama'ira e yinu nimi naba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">Gagu o gyamwa cheu yek makwada maba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Zwam e wando e taazhe o tusong owaba shi, yahudawa ashi ato bitaga na Onhon. uni zwam ampane nahi ne Ama zwam eyinga nyabashi, aba shi ato a Onhon o kudage uni henda zwam shikaka she shikaka shaba ne. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Zwam e pano e suba e Onhon na ogo ob ishiyi ene e Onhon owa geu ba. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Da gahi ana aza yahudawa, gahi shi ato nagu ehogo wo Onhon ne, Ama yanzu henda e hiu e hogo e nyama bando nagu ehoge e yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Nani ma yahudawa ashi ato nagu e hogo wo Onhon yanzu uni henda zwam ahi ehogo e nyama bando o ehogo e nyama ete e Onhon o me chibane. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Zwam Onhon o maringya ato kuchi ta ato zharo a nagu o e swabo nyaba. Ushi nani zwam o chibane e hogo e nyama bando owaba kuchi.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyabo wo Onhon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Inga e gagau e tukwara to turenge to Onhon!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Tukwara to edaku e ob henda tuza inyaka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Aduba a ob a hyange bishina̱ bya rutage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Yena a ene ob o shagu e hyange bishina̱ be gano!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />&lt;&lt; Ga bu tabo daki so o Botʻbutuwaga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Ga bu tabo shi buchagiya bu taazhe na ob!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />&lt;&lt;Ga bu tabo pa Onhon iyi maya har ob owa nsa Onhon o me daura̱tumi boik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Zwam ob ne ushi ko nya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Henda irine kuchi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Ko nya eraga shagu zwam ob.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Ga edanduwa e tabachi wo Onhon har dududu! kaniya.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Botʻbwakimga Bo Panga Muhondo Mupwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Gahi achagiya , Onhon oyo honzhe. Zwamnani na on roko nuhi e tuta kingi na kahi bando Botʻbwakimga ta uhunchi one o yo na muhondo, one oza turiya oidandago e Onhon, zwam nani ne ob ushi tugyam natuhi to tamahinda wo Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Eta yada turenge na tuhi to swabi tunane iri o duniya uniya, ama ga Onhon o sake hale nahi kuchi, zwam e tabachi na ene e Onhon o kudage, wato ene e yo honzhe, iya echiwa wo Onhon, na henda e shindushindu wo. <verse eid="ROM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Bando iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon o na shagi na on shagi ko ga bando nuhi mupas bo ta zhanga̱ reto reboba hyange ta ob o kamachie, se bu daki reto rebob, gwargwado o etano'eso e Onhon o pa boik. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Wato ta ob oyo hagami dinya na so kingi kink, hagami ate henda, a onshi enk ink ba. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Nani henda gatu tu yo dinya, tu yo hutarane na so kingi ke Botʻbwakimga, ko ga henda bando nuti gami a buhunwa ne. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Zwam gatuzhe tupano to Onhon iri-iri, gwargwado o iyi bura̱̱ e Onhon o tu shagi, to, se tushi enk na toba. Shi tushi to e hyanagu, se tushi enk na toba ta etano'eso niti, <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />shi tushi to hidima, tushi hidima nuti, bone bo on chibaga taaje o Onhon henda, bando echibaga e bob, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />bone bo on dauratumaga so henda bando edauratumu e bob, bone bo shagu usumbugana henda, bo panga na so oinka̱, butusha henda bushi enk a bob na kamahima, bone bo shagu enk a ehogo e yam boraga shagu na e paso e shinu.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupas Zwam Ashinya ana Aswabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Tukudago tushi shindushindu. E wonje ene ishi mugu, e humga ene ishi e bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Bando tukudago to ahunwa henda, e kudaga ahuwa nahi dinya. Bando e panga e tuwaga henda, koga bo raga panga buhunwa. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Eta sha maringi wo kamahima, emakimga hima bando uhunchi, gahi gyamata Botʻbutuwaga na so chen. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ga etano'eso nihi e me sape so chen, gahi kama ibga na maduru, gahi kama hima na menga ko gagu owana. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />E banga ato Onhon ane a za, e che ato kanya na yaba nihi e shagi yek iyi bura̱̱.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />E tane ana a on kame panga maduru yinu bura̱̱, e kaba Onhon o tane yek yinu bura̱̱, eta tana yek yinu wo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Eraga shaga so chen na ane a on so chen, eraga shaga tudaro na ane a on tudaro. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ishi so chen na ko ga. Eta dandaga reto, etuta reto narihi bando e shagu tawali'u. Eta zhaga hato nahi ezhe turenge.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Etama tupa mugunta mo buto mai na mugunta. E hina yingyaga enk nahi ashi a bura̱̱ na bishina̱ be koga. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Shi o pwashi wo gahi, ishi inyanka e kokari nuhi ishi ashinya a bura̱̱ na koga. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Gahi ana a gyamu kudage eta ma tupa, se de e gageya so shen o Onhon. Zwam oyo herange nezwama, &lt;&lt; Ketupe kishi na kimi, gyamwa tupa koga, gyam Botʻbutuwaga nange nani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Nanani ta atak a Onhon ange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">&lt;&lt; Shi bone bo bu wonje bu raga hoge remyaro, o pa boik kuryago.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">Shi bo on hoge tu'oware o pa oik mani ma eswa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Zwam bando o nani ne gahi nya zuranga ora na reto ryaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Eta yada mugunta mure mahonre na mahi, ama e numi mugunta na iyi bura̱.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">A Swabi ana a Sherago aduba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Ushiu dole koga bo swabi ana a sherago hadoba. Zwam aza mahonre ma maya se na Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Zwam koga bushi nagu o ehogo wo ana a shirango hadoba, bu shagiu esapo e Onhon ba un, ana a shagiu esapo e Onhon muyinsa henda a shereu yek hadoba. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />zwam henda ana a shirange hadoba ashi iyi ryansa wo ab ba, se ana a shagu mugu o enk. Bu kudage ota huga ryansa re ana a shiryago hadoba? To, ushi ene e shi e bura̱, bwa henda bo me shagiu kuyabo. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Zwam bob bushi bugyam bo Onhon, zwam ashinya na hi a bura̱̱. Ama shi gab shi bot bo enk ana aza a bura̱, to, o hoge ryansa, zwam ba suba ne bob bo on humgani na epopo e geso ba. Ai, bob bushi bugyam bo Onhon, bone bo topage mugu na so shani. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Zwam nani oyo honzhe ushi ene e yo honzhe, ba zwam tusomo to so sheni suba ba, ama zwam gahi daki nezwama oyo honzhe ishi nani. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ushi dole henda e tupe ganda, ana a sheryange hadoba ashi agyam a Onhon, yek a panga kuchi gagu owaba zwam enk ani. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />E pa koga hombe o bob, a echago e ganda e pa yek ganda, ato kurubi o ukachaga e pa yek, ana a kamachie eswabo e swabi yek, ana a kamachie e panga e tuwaga e pa yek tuwaga. <verse eid="ROM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Eta yada humbe o koga o nya na reto nihi, se de hombe ote o tukudago to hato, zwam bone bo kudage buhuwa bushindu hadoba ba un. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Na so atak a hadoba azhe hadoba ana ange nezwama, &lt;&lt; O ta sha tugari, o ta honna buto, ota sha buhi, ota hoga so na bot,&gt;&gt; Na henda esapo emai apara yek kuchi wo behenrya bene nezwama, &lt;&lt; U kudaga buhunwa nabobe ta gab kudage reto na rebe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Shi bukudage buhunwa na bobe aza kata a ba sha o shagi boik makwada. Zwam nani tukudago tushi ene e esapo e yo parage.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ushiu dole ishi nani, zwam gahi daki nezwama gagu ushiu one o gahya nyachingi bando murabo. Zwam yanzu tushiu kusa na echeu ene e gatu che tun na Jigu o gatu rwage tana sowa. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ageta a shiu, bungo o nya kore. Se tu pashe enk a tunshi, tushi tupara na iya parage a tubanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tushi tu hano na tuti ta ob o kamachie ashi henda na onhwanho, ba naso o shashanchi na marwa ba, ko tugari na pajirchi,ko na kama numaga na kama hogo o so ba. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ama e zhangi so o Botʻbutuwaga Yesu Botʻbwakimga, henda eta zhanga̱ so o ato duniya uni zwam eswabo e ekudago e sowa.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ota pana buhuwa na bobiya makwada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />E che bone bo etano e mahinda bob e shiu mahonre ba, ama eta sha gembo o makwada ma bob shi ra'aye nahi a shiu ink na a bob ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />E tano e mahinda e bob mai nya yaduwa boik bure konya e bob bukudage ere, ama bot bone bu za mahore wo etano e mahinda ma bob, se hazunga a lambu suba bob bu raga re. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />kuchi bone bu ryage konya buta yaga bone bu ryage ko iri kwana kuryago ba henda bune bo ryage ko iri kwana kuryago ba, buta zachiya bone bu ryage ko kwana kuryago, zwam Onhon o rego o shiu boik. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />ab shi ga gabwa zache bagyam bu bot mai makwada? ko bugyam bone bu shiu enk a bura̱,ko henda bu shiu ba, ai, uni ushi o buchi bo yaba e bob ne. Tamahinda a daura̱tumi boik bu yinsa, zwam Botʻbutuwaga bu pwa sa boik bu re nasara.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Bot mai buraga hyanaga oho oik o hyange a mai tuwaga. Na e hya e bu mai henda ko mwana muge mu yo dede. ko ga bu hi mahinda ma bob na so bob. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Kuchi bone bu hyanagi oho oink na tuwaga, bu raga shi nani ne zwam a pa Botʻbutuwaga tu oto. kuchi bune bo ryage ko iri kwana kuryago bu raga shi nani zwam a pa Bot-butuwaga tuwaga, zwam bu shagu godiya zwam kuryago kuni kuchi bone bu ryago ko iri kwana kuryago ba bob ma bu on shi nani zwam a pa Botʻbutuwaga tuwaga, zwam bob ma bu gwadagi Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Na so nuti , ba zwam ampane a reto niti gatu on shi muhondo ba. ba zwam ampane a reto rebob bu raga u ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Shi tu on muhondo, zwam Botʻbutuwaga ne gatu on shi, shi henda u'u, zwam nani ko muhondo ko u'u gatu on shi,gatu shi a Botʻbutuwaga. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Zwam Bot-bwakimga bu u henda bu mashingiu na muhondo zwam bushi Botʻbutuwaga bwa ana a owagi, na henda bu ana ayo na muhondo. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Gab no? Gab hend zwam nya gab raga remaga buhuwa na bu be? kuchi nuti twa yinsa na bishina̱ be Onhon one ob owa tu shagiu aduba. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Zwam oyo heryage na otakarda o Onhon ne Zwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Tamahinda, gyamshi Botʻbutuwaga Onhon o muhondo, na angya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Ko owana ugami owa kuku na bishina̱ na bimi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Ko kabe kare ka zwamo nezwama gyamshi Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />To, ko ga bando nuti bwa pa kuroto reto re bob wo Onhon.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ota sa ato mai a henage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Zwam nani, se tu ge hale a te a e hyanagu e makwada ma hato nati. Nanani se ko ga bu zhagi na so bob nezwama bwashi dalili o udubuta o buhuwa ko busape bu huwa bu hinage zwam bob ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Na daki, na yo henda na edaku e mahinda na so Botʻbutuwaga Yesu, nezwama aza iyi maya ene e yo na turiya gagu Onhon ushi yeka. Ama shi bot mai bu zhagi iyi mai nezwama ishi iyi turiya to wo bob ne iyi te e yo na turiya. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Shi iyi gab on re e zhangya buhuwa na bu be damuwa, ba ashinya a tukudago gab on shi ba u ta sha bando o kuryago kune ko gab on re kushi yena o hachigaga e buhuwa na bobiya, bune bo Bot-bwakimga bu u zwam boba. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Oka sha ene e shi e bura̱ na yisha nabe ishi iyahyanga na yisha ato mai. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Zwam Tugwama to Onhon ba tushi tozhe o adalchi ne, na ashiya a bura̱ na so chen wo uhunchi o bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Kuchi bone buraga shagyaga Bot-bwakimga tugyam bando o yina uni bob bushi bo sapo Onhon so chen ne, boi hiu e ayaje wo ato. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Zwamnani, ga tu shi inyaka e kokari nuti, zwam tushi ene nya zhagu ashinya a bura̱ na kama dauratumu o hato nati. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />E ta hachigaga enk a Onhon zwam taazhe o ere e kuryago. ta mahinda ko kwana kuryago kushi ku burya, ama uza honzhe shi kurgago ko gab on re ku sape bot mai bushi udubuta., <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Oyo honzhe u ta rya munego, ko u su mani ma inabi, ko ushi ko iri nya na shi nya sapo buhuwa na bube bu hinage. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ga ko iri raʻayi ana a gab yo na ab bando ere na esu ushi unshe nuhi na Onhon yinu bura̱ e yo wo bone bo so bob o tano boik makwada ba, bando ene e bob bu hya eyo honzhe. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama bone bu yo na so karyagya bando ene e bob bu ryage bu raga kana zhangyaga aduba a Onhon shi bu reu zwam hale ate a bob bu raga shi bu yinsa bando etano e mahinda ba, turiya ne.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Daura̱tumi Buhunwa na bo be, Ba reto re nebe ba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Gatu ato a ma honre bando e tano e mahenda niti, oyo huzhagi tuchara to ana a za mahonre, zwam tu banga yek bando o kama shimba owa ba tu ta chibano e kudago e hato. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ga ko ga bu daura̱tumi buhunwa so iyi bura̱ ne, zwam ampane a bob na henda e tano e so o bob. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Zwam ko Bot-bwakimga ma bu kudako reto re bob ba. Ta ob o yo heryange nezwama, &lt;&lt; A na a raga kabu zwagaga o maringe wo gyam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Zwam kuchi ene nyaba heryange tu da na so otakarda tu da na so otakarda Onhon a heryange oik ne zwam a tu chibaga, zwam tu nya ne tano e so bando kama ibga ne dauratumu ene e yo na otakarda Onhon o raga katupanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Ga Onhon one o panga ma'ipa na e dauratumu e so o wuti wo gahi nya ma ibga na hato na hi gagu o gahi on yena o Bot-bwakimga Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Na nani henda gahi nya,na yinu oink, na nupi oik henda, gahi dandaga Onhon one ushi Buch bo Botʻbutuwaga Yesu Bot-bwakimga. <verse eid="ROM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />E mache na wa biryagya biryagya ta Bot-bwakimga boi che wa biryagya zwam e sape a dandage Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Zwam na raga ke zwamga nezwama ene e nsa Bot-bwakimga bushi boi bangaga wo yahudawa ob ne zwam a chibane mahinda ma bihera be Onhon, zwam a tabachi na kama ira e yinu e ob na shikaka she shikaka shaba, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Zwam henda ana aza yahudawa a dandage Onhon Zwam e hogo e nyama ob. ta ob o yo heryange nezwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt; Zwamnani, Bot-butuwaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Na bu shagi ku yabo bando al'umai na shi hazuga a kuyabo na reze ne be.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Be herya bene be yo heryange na otakarda onhon be zwamaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Gahi ana aza yahudawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Ishi so chen taba na ato Onhon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />A zwamaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;E shagi Botʻbutuwaga kuyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Gahi ana aza yahudawa kuchi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">E shagi oik kuyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Gahi ebenchi kuchi, <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Henda ishaya nyange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;&lt;Bu mai bando ripitu re Yesse bwa ma chibano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Bwa mashinge bushi tugwama to ana a za yahudawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Bando buba ne ebenchi nya ta no so.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ga Onhon one o panga e tano eso oi pa so chen dinya na ashinya a bura̱ na gagu o gahi raga tanaga so wo ob, zwam e shinji na tuhinwa na e tano eso bando mahonre ma hunchi o bura̱.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Banga e Buhu wo Ana a za yahudawa</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ahuwa nami, gyam na reto rinimi na yado ne zwam, gahi hato nahi e yo shinji na kirki e yo henda shinji na edaku dinya, har e dama e ma chibaga hato nahi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Bando e hyango ni mi na sher sabchiya, na on tazhe bando iyi mai zwam na me butare na shi nani henda zwam tupano tu te to Onhon o na shagi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />One o sa gyam shi bugyam bo Bot-bwakimga Yesu bando ana aza yahudawa Na on hidima o ezwamago e anabare a tusongo a u Onhon zwam ana aza yahudawa yek ashi uhunchi oi cheu wo Onhon, one owaba guzhagi bando uhunchi o bura̱. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Zwamnani na pwashi makungu na so Bot-bwakimga Yesu wo enk a gyam on shagi Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Na shi mahore ma so e shi taazhe o iyi mai ba, se ene e Bot-bwakimga bushi bando nu mi. ire te eb ne, ta aba numi ana aza yahudawa wo isha e eswabo e Onhon bando taazhe numi na enk nami, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Bando mahonre ma iyahyani na ehyanagu, kuchi henda bando mahonre ma uhunchi on shiu har kuro Ilirikum na shiu ezwamago e taazhe o tusongo Bot-bwakimga har na shidu enk ane kuchi. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ko hwane miya numi ob ne ishi mupas mo taazhe o tusungo ko pa pane pa aba daki Bot-bwakimga ba, zwam okasha nezwam na on rema bando bot mai ne zagu bo remage. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Nanani, se de ta ob oyo herange nezwama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;A ne aba tab shagi yek taazhe o eb ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">Yek a hya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">A na a tabo hoge ana bare a Yesu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">Yek a daku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Uni ob o sa ko hwane a raga kana nyasanga koro wo gahi<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shiri O Bulus O Ringachi Rama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Yanzu henda na hwagu enk nami wariya na mushepo muni, henda na raga ke absaga har shekara dinya na koro wo gahi na me hya, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Nama kimga na ringachi wo gahi. Na on menga gagu o gyamwa karegeu koro tonge to sipen, na swabo wo gahi na me ringachi. na on menga henda shi na hogo tusongo to ashiya na gahi o gagu chimu, na re tusha na tuhano na tumi koro wari na ebanga̱ nihi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Yanzu na koro urushalima zwam e shebke ebanga̱ wo ana aza turiya a na a yo wariya. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ikilisiya ene e yo na makidoniya na henda na akaya a hogo tusongo to e panga e a na a yo na nagu bando a na aza turiya na urushalima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Yek a hogo tusungo to esha e nani, ko na ob o sa hombe o ab ne na ob ushi ana aza yahudawa a hiu rabo owaba o iyi bura̱ e uhunchi wo yahudawa, o shagiu yek ta otash ba un yek ashi enk na tuhiu twaba tu duniya zwam yek a tope buka o owa yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Shi henda na hwagu enk a ne, na daki ne zwama na tuta yek ene e banga nya ba pa zwam aba, na swabo yeno koro sipen, na ringachi wo gahi gagu o gyamwa koro wariya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Na tabatu nezwam shi na korwa wo gahi, na koro na iyi bura̱ e Bot-bwakimga shinji. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ahuwa, zwam Bot-butuwaga na buti Yesu Bot-bwakimga na henda bando tukudago tune to uhunchi o raga panga, na on roko nuhi e na banga, bando maduru na mami na menga wo Onhon. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />E na shagi menga zwam e hi e chago na wa ana aza a swabo na tonge to yahudiya, zwam henda ebanga̱ e gyamwa tuta na urushalima e cheu wo ana aza turiya ana a yo pab. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Na nani ne, shi na ni Onhon o kundage, na eso wo gahi na so chen, na hi henda ohengo taba na gahi. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Onhon one o panga ashinya a bura̱ o nya taba na gahi kuchi. kaniya.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Uzwano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Gyam Bulus nazhe iyi bura̱̱ e gyamwa me zwama nareto re buhuwa na buti Pibi, ene ishi bugyam bo Onhon na so ana a on swabi Onhon na Kankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />E che ek na wa biryagya zwam Botʻbutuwaga ta ato Onhon a shagu, e pa boik kuchi ene e bob bwakudago wo gahi, zwam bob ma bo banga ato dinya, bona bonga gyam reto na rimi taba. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ena zwangya Bilkisu na Akila, achagiya nami na so Botʻbwakimga Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />ana a tano reto ryaba wo u'u zwam gyam, ba henda gyam gyamu gyam on gwada yek ba, ama na kuchi ana a on swabi Onhon wo al'umai. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Na zwangya ana a on swabi Onhon ab kama haraga na yaba nyaba. Na zwangya bone bo gyam kudage dinya Abainatas, bone bushi bot bo Jigu bando ana a taneso na Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />E zwange Mariyamu, mane ma meshagiwa enk dinya henda na mahinda. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />E na zwangya Andarinikas na Yuniyas, ana ashi yahudawa ahuwa nami, a chagiya nami a tuparo, ana ab a daki yek honzhe bando atuma, har ashi ana na rwagi gyam echeu e Botʻbwakimga.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />E zwange Ampiliyatus, bone bo gyam kudage bando eswabo e Botʻbutuwaga. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />E zwange Urbanaus buchagiya bo enk na buti na so Botʻbwakimga, na henda bone bo gyam kudage Sitakis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />E na zwangya henda Apalis, bwayajiya bote na so Botʻbwakimga. E zwange ato a Aristobulus. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />E zwange buhuwa nabumi Hirudiyan E zwange ana ashi a Botʻbutuwaga na so ato Narkisus. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />E zwange tarapina na Tirayipusa ana a onshi enk a Botʻbutuwaga. E zwange Parsis, bwaa bone bwaba kudage, bone bo shiu enk a Botʻbutuwaga dinya henda na mahinda. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />e zwange Rupus, Bone bo shero reze bando eswabo e Botʻbutuwaga, na henda yini a eb, yini nami henda. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />e zwange Asinkiritus, na Piligona, na Hamisa, na Baturobas, na Hamasa na henda ahuwa ana a yo taba naba. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />E zwange pililugusa, na yuliya, na Niriyas, na buhuwa bo eb bo twaa, na ulumpas na henda kuchi ana aza turiya ana ayo taba naba. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />E raga kana zwangaga na uzwano une o Onhon o kudage.kuchi ana a on swabi Botʻbwakimga a on kame zwamgaga.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupas Mwakundaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Gyam Bulus na on roko nuhi, ahuwa nami, ishi honzhe na ana a kudage a me undagage, ana a on bitaga na echibagano ene e gahi koyi, a raga usapago udubuta, ishi hwanya naba. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />ai, iri atwani araga gyamata Botʻbutuwaga na buti Botʻbwakimga, ama bando ab, bando taaje owaba o tusongo na e hogo e ana aza edaku a be pwatumaga ana aza e daku e Onhon dinya na sowaba. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ama gahi kam, ai, koga bo daki e swabo nihi, obo sa gyam onshi so chen na gahi, se de na kudage e daki ene ishi e bura̱ eraga henda shaga ek, ama ishi ana aza mugunta. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Onhon one o panga ashinya a bura̱̱ henda, owasa e pundage bugwama bo muphar gyabogyabo iyi bura̱̱ e Botʻbutuwaga na buti Yesu Botʻbwakimga e tabachi wo gahi.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, buchagiya na bumi bo enk bo on kame zwangaga, nani henda lukiyas na yason. na henda susiba taras, ahuwa nami.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Gyamu Tartiyas, bone bo gyam on heranga atakarda uni, na on kame zwanga zwam Botʻbutuwaga.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus, bone bona kazhiya, bone bo on kazhaga kuchi ana ashi aswabo a Onhon, e on kame zwangaga. Arastas, buti ira to shepo, na henda buhuwa na buti kawartas, na henda buhuwa na buti kawartas, a on kame zwangaga. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />iyibura e Botʻbutuwaga na buti Yesu Bot-bwakimga e nya wo gahi kuchi Amin, A min.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E hwagu na Kuyabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Edanduwa e tabachi wo bo iko e kame panga e mahonre ma so bando anabare a tusongo nami, bando e mupas mo Yesu Botʻbwakimga, mune e yo swanya tun na Jigu o konya dududu. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ama yanzu na akundaga a zwammagaa twek. Onhon one o yo swenya o sape atuma a ob a herange anabare a tusongo, zwam ato duniya kuchi a getage henda a hi etano e so dududu. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />E edanduwa e tabachi wo Onhon one owink one ushi turenge bando Yesu Botʻbwakimga! e tabachi har dududu wo ob kaniya, kaniya.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>